@startuml
title DSD - Refactor Qiskit Circuit (GRASP: Controller + Expert + DAO)

actor User
participant "UI (React)" as UI
participant "QuantumJobController" as Controller <<Controller>>
participant "CircuitRefactorService" as Service
participant "QiskitCircuit" as Circuit <<Expert>>
participant "DuckDBCircuitDAO" as DAO <<DAO>>
datastore "DuckDB" as DB

User -> UI: Upload Qiskit code
UI -> Controller: POST /refactor
Controller -> Service: refactorLegacyCode(code)
Service -> Circuit: validate()
Circuit --> Service: valid
Service -> Circuit: transpile(level=2)
Circuit --> Circuit: transpiled circuit
Service -> Circuit: computeMetrics()
Circuit --> Service: RefactorMetrics
Service -> DAO: save(version)
DAO -> DB: INSERT
DAO --> Service: ok
Service --> Controller: CircuitVersion + metrics
Controller --> UI: 200 JSON
UI --> User: Show before/after + KPIs
@enduml